  "bootstrap": [
    "From the repository root, explicitly run: node scripts/prepare-backend-sonar-cpd.mjs logs/backend-sonar-review.local/runtime/cpd-26.4.0.121862",
    "The bootstrap downloads only the 61 pinned official SonarSource source files and seven pinned Maven Central JARs listed below. It verifies SHA-256 before exclusive atomic publication, reuses matching existing files, and preserves mismatching existing files by failing.",
    "Downloaded module sources and JARs stay in the caller-selected ignored logs runtime. The bootstrap starts no service and uploads no project source. Each invocation retains provenance, including cache reuse and partial failure.",
    "Create an explicit local config using exampleConfig, then run: node scripts/check-backend-duplication.mjs <config.json>. All configured paths are relative to that config file. This separate checker never downloads anything.",
    "The check inventories all backend/src/main/java Java files, compiles official code in a fresh ignored run directory, runs five threshold/normalization controls, and rejects input or inventory drift.",
    "PASS means the check completed, not zero duplication; inspect both group counts and every endpoint in the report. No SonarQube-server quality gate or new-code metric is claimed."
  ],
